• What quality standards and testing certify remanufactured products as equivalent to new?
• How should remanufactured products be branded or labeled to avoid stigma?
• What warranty or performance guarantees assure users of reliability?
• How can remanufacturing processes be made visible and trustworthy to consumers?
• What pricing strategy positions remanufactured products competitively?
• How does design facilitate efficient remanufacturing and repeat cycles?